face, and you can also develop games with the iScript language, specifically developed for this engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >iScript is a scripting language specifically developed for 2D game development. The engine includes tutorials and sample code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore sample projects to learn how games are developed and develop your own games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With JS-Engine, you can develop 2D games in the browser. Because this engine runs in the browser, you can use it on all platforms. You can also find the user manual and sample projects for this engine within the application.</p>","developers":["ismail \u00f6zel"],"genres":[{"description":"Game Development","id":"60"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960310/3c153101786afb1da85d0ff19246506b6747f071/header.jpg?t=1762108683","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3960310/1930926821/b36db1921f97ed73be9438a1fb0fb65b99c3ec1d/1757541166/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757570089","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3960310/1930926821/b36db1921f97ed73be9438a1fb0fb65b99c3ec1d/1757541166/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757570089","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3960310/1930926821/b36db1921f97ed73be9438a1fb0fb65b99c3ec1d/1757541166/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757570089","id":257195876,"name":"iscEngine Example Games","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257195876/7ac8e0351063b8252ebf5f3e8eab11f1ea5339e2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757570089"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3960310/552117366/424af4e150a3f67c6881d9e74addac536ebdc76f/1757414984/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757570092","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3960310/552117366/424af4e150a3f67c6881d9e74addac536ebdc76f/1757414984/dash_h264.mpd?t